  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing the capacity of the SGBV protection services in Gutu.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam will work with Musasa, the referral system, traditional and religious leaders organisations, and community structures with agency and influence to enhance comprehensive services to survivors of Sexual and Gender Based Violence (SGBV). Utilising Oxfam Zimbabwe&apos;s humanitarian action experience, Oxfam will upgrade the shelter and improve the shelter&apos;s capacity to provide enhanced SGBV services to survivors from surrounding villages.</narrative>
  </description>
